+- +15m: overall 48 · host 30 · kitchen 77 · labor 18 · revenue 62
+- +30m: overall 55 · host 39 · kitchen 85 · labor 22 · revenue 68
+- +45m: overall 63 · host 50 · kitchen 94 · labor 28 · revenue 74
+- +60m: overall 69 · host 58 · kitchen 99 · labor 32 · revenue 80
+- +90m: overall 65 · host 46 · kitchen 92 · labor 36 · revenue 92
+
+Current intervention queue:
+
+1. Kitchen throughput — action threshold in 15 minutes
